WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,440
Hurry up and act boldly with confidence

2
00:00:01,440 --> 00:00:03,080
This is a high-quality chicken oil yellow jadeite

3
00:00:03,080 --> 00:00:04,240
Top quality jadeite bright

4
00:00:04,240 --> 00:00:06,080
The market valuation is only a few billion

5
00:00:06,080 --> 00:00:07,800
It's our boss's personal belongings

6
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:11,120
If it breaks, you don’t have to pay a cent. Luo Peng, shut up.

7
00:00:11,120 --> 00:00:12,240
Fat people brag every chance they get

8
00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:13,560
I really thought that this overwhelming wealth was brought by the strong wind

9
00:00:13,560 --> 00:00:14,480
I have to find a chance to hit him.

10
00:00:14,480 --> 00:00:17,450
So as not to be too ostentatious

11
00:00:17,450 --> 00:00:19,070
Billions

12
00:00:19,070 --> 00:00:21,150
Who dares to lift billions of stones?

13
00:00:21,150 --> 00:00:22,590
Even if you beat me to death, I won’t do it.

14
00:00:22,590 --> 00:00:24,470
Billions of emeralds

15
00:00:24,470 --> 00:00:28,050
Just use it as a test prop. Oh my god.

16
00:00:28,090 --> 00:00:31,160
What a terrifying gold-banded leg I have embraced

17
00:00:31,160 --> 00:00:32,800
This boss is really good at playing

18
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:34,800
Use billions of jade as barbells

19
00:00:34,800 --> 00:00:37,110
It's probably a foam prop, right?

20
00:00:37,110 --> 00:00:39,190
It is definitely a prop to test your courage and character.

21
00:00:39,190 --> 00:00:40,190
If this is true

22
00:00:40,190 --> 00:00:41,930
Who dares to hit the ground?

23
00:00:41,930 --> 00:00:44,610
Why are you afraid that I won’t be able to fall if I’m here?

24
00:00:48,870 --> 00:00:51,190
I'd just say it's a plastic foam prop.

25
00:00:51,190 --> 00:00:53,390
Even an immortal can't lift five hundred pounds with one hand.
